{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16206120","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16206120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1620612001:0":{"text":"다리가 이제는 안 떨려요... 감사합니다.","source_cn":"我的腿不抖了……谢谢……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0C345C30E5DB846C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다리가 이제는 안 떨려요... 감사합니다.","female":"다리가 이제는 안 떨려요... 감사합니다.","variant_male_record_index":"215216","variant_female_record_index":"215217","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620612002:0":{"text":"방금 말한 유령이 뭐야?","source_cn":"你刚刚说的幽灵，是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x627F4406CF63BC20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620612003:0":{"text":"라이세움에 떠도는 소문인데, 실종된 학생들도 이 소문이랑 관련이 있대.","source_cn":"是流传莱希拉姆的传闻，有些学生失踪据说也跟这些传闻有关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D7A870879224CDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620612004:0":{"text":"그중 한 버전이... “유령”이랑 관련이 있다잖아.","source_cn":"其中有一个版本……就跟“幽灵”有关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC70A3FF659E0113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620612005:0":{"text":"그 소리는 이 세계의 것이 아니라 “저편”에서 들려오는 거래.","source_cn":"据说那种声音不是这个世界的东西，是从“另一边”传来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6A516EACE365513","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620612006:0":{"text":"그 소리를 따라가다 보면 유령에게 끌려가게 되고... 영영 돌아오지 못한대...","source_cn":"只要你顺着那声音走，就会被幽灵带走——永远不会回来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6166841CA52BF9DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1620612006":{"text":"그 소리를 따라가다 보면 유령에게 끌려가게 되고... 영영 돌아오지 못한대...","source_cn":"只要你顺着那声音走，就会被幽灵带走——永远不会回来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6166841CA52BF9DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620612007:0":{"text":"실종은 장난이 아니라고요... 못 돌아올지도 몰라요!","source_cn":"失踪可不是开玩笑的……很可能再也回不来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ED9CFB7A79D925C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620612009:0":{"text":"나도 무서워... 그런데 궁금해.","source_cn":"我其实也很怕……可我想过去看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE292DE2D122AA213","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620612010:0":{"text":"가서 보겠다고? 정말 안 무서워? 우리는 신입생이라 유령을 쫓는 마법도 모르는데, 유령이랑 맞설 생각이야?","source_cn":"你居然想去看看，你真的不怕吗？我们是新生，连驱逐幽灵的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC0988EAF7513259","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620612011:0":{"text":"난 그냥... 교실에서 자습하는 게 트라우마가 되는 건 싫어. 지금 물러서면 앞으로는 어떡해? 거기서 몇 년은 밤새워야 하는데.","source_cn":"我只是……不想连在教室自习都变成心理阴影。如果现在退缩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A76E52B5268C841","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620612012:0":{"text":"그리고... 우리한테는 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>도 있잖아? 어쩌면 이건 확인해 볼 기회일지도 몰라.","source_cn":"而且——我们不是有<style=stress><pla...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C80B6C645AE42AB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그리고... 우리한테는 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>도 있잖아? 어쩌면 이건 확인해 볼 기회일지도 몰라.","female":"그리고... 우리한테는 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>도 있잖아? 어쩌면 이건 확인해 볼 기회일지도 몰라.","variant_male_record_index":"215228","variant_female_record_index":"215229","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620612013:0":{"text":"세상에...<shk>진짜 다 미쳤나 봐!</shk> 유령한테 잡혀가면 어떡하려고!","source_cn":"<shk>你们简直疯了！</shk>幽灵会把你们拖走的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04D34F62E18C488C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1620612013":{"text":"세상에...<shk>진짜 다 미쳤나 봐!</shk> 유령한테 잡혀가면 어떡하려고!","source_cn":"<shk>你们简直疯了！</shk>幽灵会把你们拖走的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04D34F62E18C488C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1620612014:0":{"text":"으으... 저만 두고 가지 말아요. 기다려줘요!","source_cn":"唉，你们不要丢下我自己啊！等等我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEB901DD524DF5CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"유령한테 잡혀간다고? 내가 누군지 몰라?","source_cn":"你要担心的，是幽灵会害怕我","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFC50AC2282D440F5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"유령한테 잡혀간다고? 내가 누군지 몰라?","female":"유령한테 잡혀간다고? 내가 누군지 몰라?","variant_male_record_index":"85855","variant_female_record_index":"85856","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"넌 여기 남아 있어도 돼","source_cn":"你可以留下来","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8CB50DC86A59ECA5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"넌 여기 남아 있어도 돼","female":"넌 여기 남아 있어도 돼","variant_male_record_index":"85857","variant_female_record_index":"85858","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"또 다른 세계라니, 재미있네","source_cn":"另一个世界，很有趣啊","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA0ACCE3B705518AF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"또 다른 세계라니, 재미있네","female":"또 다른 세계라니, 재미있네","variant_male_record_index":"85851","variant_female_record_index":"85852","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1620612008:0":{"text":"저도 마법은 믿지만! 제 마법이... 충분히 강하지 않은가 봐요......","source_cn":"我也相信魔法，但……也许我的魔法还不够强吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2CCD2059DAADDF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title